Let nums be a list of -1, 0, 1, and 2.
Sort nums.
Let last be the last position of nums.
For every first from 0 to last.
Let second be one more than first.
Let third be last.
Repeat while second is less than third.
Let total be item first of nums plus item second of nums plus item third of nums.
If total is less than 0, add 1 to second.
If total is more than 0, subtract 1 from third.
If total is 0, print item first of nums, print item second of nums, print item third of nums, print "---", add 1 to second, subtract 1 from third.
